WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
The monthly payment and the cash needed

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.340
to buy answer different questions.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.220
You need to look at both.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.080
The down payment is only part of

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.293
the upfront cost. There are closing costs

00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:11.620
to plan for, too.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.280
And the money in your account may

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.760
also need to cover moving, repairs or

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.600
savings you want to keep.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.880
Separate those amounts before deciding how much

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.280
you want to use.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.600
Leave unconfirmed costs as questions for an

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.320
estimate. The cash planner brings those questions

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.160
together. Review your answers before sending them

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.640
to me, or print the list for

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.610
yourself.
